Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(desktop):=20=E2=8C=98B=20marks=20a=20sessi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?on=20blocked=20=E2=80=94=20grey=20stripe,=20skipped=20by=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=8C=98]=20/=20=E2=8C=98[=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New session.toggleBlocked (⌘B) flips a per-session 'blocked' flag on the
selected (else focused) session, persisted in localStorage and matched across
the compression lineage. A blocked row draws a grey status stripe instead of
green/red, and ⌘] / ⌘[ skip it (⌘⇧] / ⌘⇧[ still step to it). Pressing ⌘B
again unblocks. The sidebar toggle moves from ⌘B to ⌥⌘B.
---
